# `then` no longer exists in match and loops: the code goes after `done;` (negative test)
** spec: semantics/control.md#loops
primary aspect a85_then_removed is
  process main is
    for i in (1..3) do
      print "i = {i}";
    then
      print "after";
    done;
  return;
end a85_then_removed;
/*@expect
{
  "exit": 65,
  "syntax_error": true,
  "contains": [
    "'then' no longer exists"
  ]
}
*/
